{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K0hRbg_iwn8DycQuyBoyZg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:53.547337+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K0hRbg_iwn8DycQuyBoyZg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/BB5yh269nUia4NzTYWEkmhfOP5InQoCCxicFfGdcmAn652pjFbqiaW5mBPTicPF7oMgaC2BLYmCN5TCpKpSgzibdoNEQiacic1qrDzhgDyH42Gictpc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>南京审计大学经济学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>硕士学位研究生报名要求</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>为方便考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，南京审计大学经济学院将开展2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生（简称推免生）预报名工作，欢迎广大考生积极报名。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南京审计大学经济学院全日制学术学位：理论经济学（020100）、应用经济学（020200），全日制专业学位：税务（025300）、国际商务（025400）、数字经济（025800）,硕士招生专业均接收推免生，接收推免生总人数不超过硕士研究生招生计划的50%。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>考生根据预报名通知在线登记相关信息，待教育部正式开通系统后（9月21日），考生须通过“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”）报名，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党领导，拥护社会主义制度，</span><span><span>遵纪守法，品德良好，具有社会责任感。</span></span></p><p><span>2.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>3.纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，获得所</span><span><span>在学校的推荐免试资格（预报名阶段，对于尚未确定但仍有可</span></span><span><span>能获得推免生资格的申请人可同样进行申请，正式报名阶段未</span></span><span><span>取得推免生资格的，录取资格自动取消）。</span></span></p><p><span>4.满足教育部其他相关要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名申请</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>符合条件的考生于9月20日前点击相关学院的报名链接，</span><span><span>在线填写报名信息，提交报名材料扫描件电子版。</span></span></p><p><span>（一）报名材料清单</span></p><p><span>1.南京审计大学推荐免试生政治思想情况表（签名盖章）</span></p><p><span>2.诚信承诺书（本人签名）</span></p><p><span>3.身份证（正、反面）</span></p><p><span>4.《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（学信网认证）</span></p><p><span>（二）联系方式</span></p><p><span>电话：025-58318560</span></p><p><span>人员：陈老师、疏老师</span></p><p><span>邮箱：dsrg-soe@nau.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.待教育部推免系统开通后，所有考生均须在“全国推荐</span><span><span>免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）正式报名，否则申请无效。</span></span></p><p><span>2.我校将根据教育部推免生政策，及时公布 2027年接收</span><span><span>推免生的相关信息，请及时关注我校研究生院及报考学院网站</span></span><span><span>信息。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>南京审计大学经济学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>研究生教育情况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学校概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2011年，成为教育部、财政部、审计署与江苏省人民政府“三部一省”共建高校；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2021年，拥有本硕博全链条人才培养体系的大学；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2023年7月4日，中共中央总书记、国家主席习近平给南京审计大学审计专业硕士国际班留学生重要回信；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>南京审计大学被誉为“最美大学”之一，美丽的校园环境和丰富的文化氛围吸引了众多学子。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、硕士点情况</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BB5yh269nUhic5ThzsGCWCvSiauoySAMNpUvgsT5OFDXhuMqicml9SHMj1jSMAict7dQBNhvb9af3cI2UPqwRnfkiakq01ibG0Ua2sCj8ibTdtEiago/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2、学科发展史</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BB5yh269nUhl6LUibtqdt9pUKW1VWtFM2QTpZLtmEeS21cGSnhWlHXjLzBchUDNa6uTOSibpcRtcVDCxcvN51k96eMbPBNMPC8wS9EMVnJWus/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/BB5yh269nUjLtYObiaUicicMLI8jDcrxn1icxh6kX3r6U9tF6wfd53gPbOgxQvTvALv3WatKa6lkrYoGGqPV8Z9r6h2D7k6TAAAlG0I71ng8Fe4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>3、学科排名</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>在全国第五轮学科评估中，我校应用经济学跃级提升，理论经济学获得进步。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>我校经济学科荣登“2021-2025软科世界一流学科排名”榜单，位列中国排名30名，世界排名271名。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2011年，成为武书连2018年中国721所大学各学科排行榜中，我校经济学科位列“A级”（全国排名5%-10%）。教育部、财政部、审计署与江苏省人民政府“三部一省”共建高校；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>我校经济学与商学（ECONOMICS &amp; BUSINESS）学科自2024年7月以来连续进入ESI全球前1%。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>软科2025中国最好学科排名中，我校理论经济学排名前30%（位列第23位，较上一年前进2位）；应用经济学排名前12%（位列第29位）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>上海财经大学高等研究院2020/2021年发布《全球高校经济学研究力》，2017-2019年全球高校经济学研究力综合权重排名中，南京审计大学位列第227位，在两岸暨港澳地区高校中排名第11位。2021年南京审计大学首次进入前十名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>学院师资力量</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>经济学院现有专任教师（含联合研究院以及双肩挑）126人。其中教育部“国家级人才”特聘教授2人，教育部“青年国家级人才”1人，国家杰出青年科学基金获得者1人，国家优秀青年科学基金获得者1人，中组部国家级领军人才1人，中组部国家级青年拔尖1人，中宣部国家级青年文化英才1人，教育部高等学校专业教学指导委员会委员1人。省级人才82人次。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>毕业生就业去向</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、研究生就业</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>党政机关与金融监管单位：考取公务员，入职审计署、财政部、税务、银保监、地方党委政府等部门，从事公共管理、经济监督等工作。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>金融机构、企业与专业服务机构：进入银行、保险、大型企业、会计师事务所、科研智库，从事经营管理、审计实务、行业研究等工作。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>☆</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>高校与科研机构：攻读博士学位，毕业后入职国内高校、社科院，从事教学科研工作。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2、研究生升学</span><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span>我院59名研究生考取浙江大学、复旦大学、南京大学、中国人民大学、同济大学、上海财经大学、中国社科院大学、中国财政科学研究院等国内知名高校攻读博士。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>撰稿排版丨朱青云</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>责编丨疏春晓</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>审核丨樊士德</span></strong></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BB5yh269nUhGNkyPUbqnguB9g61u7y3GTmOGkV0oGU5wr9Yibgs75z4eVGu0tT3nhYv1Xm9ajkiblplgn5ia7AOG8FsichibOQBGziaSvf8GIvSZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"22668f6815d46aba50f1980c67093de7a1411bd5febe9d8c6c6b70054f4adda9","textLength":1945,"sourceSha256":"58b1056436c9d020ee059abd350ad3cf1d1c9ecab2fc6ff312bbee943d1dae81","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0fd86b2df17851241e7f","title":"2026年南京审计大学经济学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:53.547337+00:00"}
